* Formant-cell decoder — one channel
*
* Pins: LINE AUDIO VCC VEE
*   LINE  — narrowband AM in
*   AUDIO — env × fixed ~1 kHz excitation (robotic; no pitch tracker)

.subckt formant_dec LINE AUDIO VCC VEE

* Same LINE bandpass as enc (reject out-of-band junk)
Ch1a LINE H1a 100n
Rh1a H1a 0 4.0k
Xh1a H1a HP1a VCC VEE HP1a TL072
Ch1b HP1a H1b 100n
Rh1b H1b 0 4.0k
Xh1b H1b HP VCC VEE HP TL072
Rl1 HP L1 13k
Cl1 L1 0 10n
Xl1 L1 BPL VCC VEE BPL TL072

Xenv BPL ENV VCC VEE logenv TAU=10m

* Synthesis carrier ~1 kHz
Vcrx CRX 0 SIN(0 1.0 1000 0 0 0)
Rcrx CRX 0 100k

Xam CRX ENV AUDIO VCC VEE am

.ends formant_dec
